@ShopApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5066
@token = paste-jwt-token-here

### [BẮT BUỘC] Đăng ký tài khoản
POST {{ShopApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "techlead01",
  "email": "techlead01@example.com",
  "password": "Strong@Pass123"
}

### [BẮT BUỘC] Đăng nhập để lấy JWT
POST {{ShopApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "techlead01",
  "password": "Strong@Pass123"
}

### Product: paging + search + filter + sort
GET {{ShopApi_HostAddress}}/api/products?pageNumber=1&pageSize=20&search=laptop&categoryId=1&minPrice=100000&maxPrice=30000000&inStock=true&sortBy=price&sortDirection=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Product: lấy chi tiết
GET {{ShopApi_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Category: paging + search + sort
GET {{ShopApi_HostAddress}}/api/categories?pageNumber=1&pageSize=20&search=electronic&sortBy=productCount&sortDirection=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Product: tạo mới
POST {{ShopApi_HostAddress}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard",
  "description": "Bàn phím cơ",
  "price": 2500000,
  "stock": 100,
  "categoryId": 1
}

### Orders: paging + search + filter + sort
GET {{ShopApi_HostAddress}}/api/orders?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10&search=laptop&status=Pending&fromDate=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z&toDate=2026-12-31T23:59:59Z&sortBy=totalAmount&sortDirection=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Liveness: process API
GET {{ShopApi_HostAddress}}/health/live
Accept: application/json

### Readiness: API + SQL Server
GET {{ShopApi_HostAddress}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json
